        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Essence:</strong> Heat / Conduction &middot; <strong>Mutation:</strong> Conductive Filament</p><p><em>Copper filaments running everywhere under the plate, visibly glowing when it works.</em></p><table><thead><tr><th>Depth</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>When a Mutation of yours deals energy damage, the target takes <strong>1 more of that type</strong> at the start of its next turn.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>When you take fire or electricity damage, your next Strike before the end of your next turn deals <strong>+1d4</strong> of that type.</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Energy damage from your Mutations <strong>conducts</strong>: one creature adjacent to the target takes <strong>2</strong> of that type.</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>The conduction becomes <strong>half</strong> the energy damage, and reaches any creature touching the same metal object, water, or surface as the target.</td></tr></tbody></table><p><em>Depth is this effect's badge. Depth 3 and 4 switch off while the Carapace is broken.</em></p>"
        },
